  "description": "<p>This personalized area rug features an exciting motorsports design with a detailed checkered flag pattern and a lifelike race track. Crafted for both safety and comfort, it includes a non-slip rubber backing and a soft polyester surface. This rug is a versatile and eye-catching decor piece that brings energy and action to various spaces, making it ideal for racing fans.</p><p></p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Customizable with a personal name or word for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>Vibrant racing and checkered flag design adds energy to any room.</li>\n<li>Soft yet durable polyester surface provides comfort underfoot.</li>\n<li>Non-slip rubber backing ensures confident grip and stability.</li>\n<li>Versatile for game rooms, patios, entryways, or living spaces.</li>\n</ul><p></p><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Checkered</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><p></p><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n</table><p></p><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This area rug is suitable for game rooms, garages, kid’s bedrooms, patios, entryways, or living spaces. Its durable construction makes it ideal for high-traffic areas and adds a bold statement to any motorsport-themed room.</p>",
